[{"client_msg_id":"da602ef3-f010-458f-a173-258e675ce103","type":"message","user":"U6XP9LZ6V","text":"`git replace --graft` は vim/vim-history でも使用例を載せています。 \u003chttps://github.com/vim/vim-history\u003e","ts":"1622092939.385700","attachments":[{"fallback":"GitHub: vim/vim-history","id":1,"title":"vim/vim-history","title_link":"https://github.com/vim/vim-history","text":"Very very old history of Vim (from v1.14 to v6.4). Contribute to vim/vim-history development by creating an account on GitHub.","image_url":"https://opengraph.githubassets.com/a14b88b5204c015beb292f2ddac6908ea2d5dc23b40dfc518d29bdfadfca6e84/vim/vim-history","blocks":null,"service_name":"GitHub","service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/github.png","from_url":"https://github.com/vim/vim-history","original_url":"https://github.com/vim/vim-history"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sasu","count":1,"users":["UPWFF5YQ7"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"f2Pvm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"19217ea7-f594-4029-ab05-f2b217a236fb","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"なんか操作が事故ったのか不明ですが\n\u003chttps://qiita.com/tsuyoshi_cho/items/8bca5ee3576da82cbba6\u003e\nのメモが役に立った(HEADがbrokenだったっぽい)","ts":"1622090780.384400","attachments":[{"fallback":"Qiita: gitのHEAD(ローカルスタート) - Qiita","id":1,"title":"gitのHEAD(ローカルスタート) - Qiita","title_link":"https://qiita.com/tsuyoshi_cho/items/8bca5ee3576da82cbba6","text":"手順はちゃんと覚えてないのですが gitを次の手順ですすめると、ローカルにHEADがない、カンジになってしまう様子。 1.サーバ(github/bitbucket)を作成 2.ローカルでファイル準備 3.git init 4.git...","image_url":"https://qiita-user-contents.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.qiita.com%2Fassets%2Fpublic%2Farticle-ogp-background-1150d8b18a7c15795b701a55ae908f94.png?ixlib=rb-4.0.0\u0026w=1200\u0026mark=https%3A%2F%2Fqiita-user-contents.imgix.net%2F~text%3Fixlib%3Drb-4.0.0%26w%3D840%26h%3D380%26txt%3Dgit%25E3%2581%25AEHEAD%2528%25E3%2583%25AD%25E3%2583%25BC%25E3%2582%25AB%25E3%2583%25AB%25E3%2582%25B9%25E3%2582%25BF%25E3%2583%25BC%25E3%2583%2588%2529%26txt-color%3D%2523333%26txt-font%3DHiragino%2520Sans%2520W6%26txt-size%3D54%26txt-clip%3Dellipsis%26txt-align%3Dcenter%252Cmiddle%26s%3D06bf8e79b1aa431f4f3b0d647b490432\u0026mark-align=center%2Cmiddle\u0026blend=https%3A%2F%2Fqiita-user-contents.imgix.net%2F~text%3Fixlib%3Drb-4.0.0%26w%3D840%26h%3D500%26txt%3D%2540tsuyoshi_cho%26txt-color%3D%2523333%26txt-font%3DHiragino%2520Sans%2520W6%26txt-size%3D45%26txt-align%3Dright%252Cbottom%26s%3D28988184078fed0460bc19b7d8627384\u0026blend-align=center%2Cmiddle\u0026blend-mode=normal\u0026s=985f28c38ad884e71f8d2e37044fae94","blocks":null,"service_name":"Qiita","service_icon":"https://cdn.qiita.com/assets/favicons/public/apple-touch-icon-ec5ba42a24ae923f16825592efdc356f.png","from_url":"https://qiita.com/tsuyoshi_cho/items/8bca5ee3576da82cbba6","original_url":"https://qiita.com/tsuyoshi_cho/items/8bca5ee3576da82cbba6"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6NcLm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"60f3094b-1119-483a-844f-df642cb4c66d","type":"message","user":"UPWFF5YQ7","text":"です。歴史を繋ぐ。","ts":"1622076998.383500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8t2Gz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2e76a6e4-5619-4aff-9f54-891fbb5c64ad","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"ああ、繋ぐようにしてってことですね(replaceはしってる)","ts":"1622076637.383200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"W5O"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fc338162-e793-4a64-a0c8-b6985415587e","type":"message","user":"UPWFF5YQ7","text":"\u0026gt; fork ではなくコピーで作られた（履歴が一致しない）リポジトリ\nちなみにこのリポジトリを最初にみたときは激おこぷんぷん丸でしたが、\nちゃんと Git はこういった運用を想定しているらしい。\n（Git は全履歴のスナップショットを保存する関係でサイズが膨大になりうるから）\n\n`git replace` というコマンドがあり、リポジトリ Ry がリポジトリ Rx のコピーであり、\nRx のあるコミット Cx と Ry の initial コミット Cy_init のファイルツリーが一致するとき、\nリポジトリ Y 上で\n```git replace Cy_init Cx ```\nとすると、 リポジトリ Ry のログは Cy_init が Cx に置き換わり、Rx の歴史も遡って見ることができるようになります。","ts":"1622076351.382200","thread_ts":"1622075703.381700","subtype":"thread_broadcast","reactions":[{"name":"hee","count":5,"users":["UFHQ7TNT0","U013QL1RAPN","U9S4G0LJW","U022J550WMQ","UMRAUJY22"]},{"name":"tips","count":1,"users":["UDPT2BZ6E"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gDf"}],"root":{"client_msg_id":"07912cd7-47b5-4702-a325-e5043601a5c2","type":"message","user":"UPWFF5YQ7","text":"format-patch、業務で fork ではなくコピーで作られた（履歴が一致しない）リポジトリに特定の機能だけ取り込ませたいときによく使います。\n\nで、だいたいコンフリクトするので以前ちょっと話題にだした range-diff で取り込み前と後のコミット範囲差分を比較してチェックする。\n```git range-diff \u0026lt;取り込み前 commit-range\u0026gt; \u0026lt;取り込み後 commit-range\u0026gt;```","ts":"1622075703.381700","thread_ts":"1622075703.381700","reply_count":2,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"88cQ"}]}},{"client_msg_id":"efcc659f-fd3b-4cde-9995-f9d68130c9a6","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"計算資源の無駄遣い感が凄い","ts":"1622075743.382100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"x+h"}]},{"client_msg_id":"57b7749c-c69c-45f7-8171-4299eea51301","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"\u003c#C03C4RC9F|random\u003e からだけどGitHub Profileの生成にCIが10分かかるようになってしまった","ts":"1622075719.381900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mvhC/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"07912cd7-47b5-4702-a325-e5043601a5c2","type":"message","user":"UPWFF5YQ7","text":"format-patch、業務で fork ではなくコピーで作られた（履歴が一致しない）リポジトリに特定の機能だけ取り込ませたいときによく使います。\n\nで、だいたいコンフリクトするので以前ちょっと話題にだした range-diff で取り込み前と後のコミット範囲差分を比較してチェックする。\n```git range-diff \u0026lt;取り込み前 commit-range\u0026gt; \u0026lt;取り込み後 commit-range\u0026gt;```","ts":"1622075703.381700","thread_ts":"1622075703.381700","reply_count":2,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"88cQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"22774c51-b216-4f22-b8f8-d6d56a9ee869","type":"message","user":"UPWFF5YQ7","text":"Cy_init のファイルツリーと一致するファイルツリーが Rx にないとき（コピーしてからちょっと手を加えて initial commit したケース）は、\n`--graft` （= 接ぎ木）オプションを足すと、中間地点のコミットオブジェクトも自動で作成してくれる。","ts":"1622076495.382500","thread_ts":"1622075703.381700","parent_user_id":"UPWFF5YQ7","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"IlwC"}]}]
